      <h1 class="Title">CODE COMPARATIVE TABLE—REVISED ORDINANCES 1962</h1>
            <p class="P1">This table gives the disposition of the sections of the Revised Ordinances of 1962, which were retained in this codification. Sections of the Revised Ordinances of 1962, not listed herein have been omitted as repealed, superseded or obsolete.</p>


